Overlay patch 0021: iOS menu quit + touch scrolling (reference 0018
intent; my 0018 number was already taken by the macUtils gates).
Quit: menu quit must CVarSave + exit(0) after Window->Close() — Close alone
leaves a frozen screen on iOS (no desktop main loop to unwind; Sync Wave 1
mandatory fix 3). Scrolling: the shell queues finger scroll deltas
(overlay 0013 rev2 exports); the menu's three scrollable children consume
them when the finger is horizontally inside the child window. Mouse-free,
so no hover tooltips and no slider side-effects. __IOS__-only.

